{"steamAppId":3713380,"description":"Build it. Master it. Win with pure will.\nForge the ultimate ARMORED CORE with your own hands.\n\nSeries Overview\nARMORED CORE MOBILE 2 is a port of the classic title originally released in 2005 for feature phones, part of FromSoftware acclaimed 3D mech action series, ARMORED CORE.\n\nGameplay Features\nThis enhanced version brings the action to life with a powerful new back-view perspective.\nSharpen your mercenary skills through training missions, including evasion drills, MT battles, and survival exercises.\nTake on the Arena Mode, where you'll face off in intense 1-on-1 battles against unique Ravens, each with their own tactics—fight your way to the top!\n\nChoose from over 50 parts, including weapons and mech components!\nGo for power, go for style—the choice is yours.\nBuild the ultimate machine that reflects your own vision!","short_description":"Build it. Master it. Win with pure will. Forge the ultimate ARMORED CORE with your own hands.","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713380/6dc609629ca4c563a87a89926f5fe7c48821ae45/header.jpg?t=1750258909","developer":"G-MODE, FromSoftware, Inc.","publisher":"G-MODE","genre":"Экшены, Симуляторы","platforms":["Windows"],"modes":["Один игрок"],"playerCount":0,"releaseLabel":"18 июн. 2025 г.","comingSoon":false,"metacritic":null,"metacriticUrl":null,"steam":89,"steamReviewCount":19,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713380/407be70b67856ae04d8deba877d4d03746e042ad/ss_407be70b67856ae04d8deba877d4d03746e042ad.600x338.jpg?t=1750258909","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713380/407be70b67856ae04d8deba877d4d03746e042ad/ss_407be70b67856ae04d8deba877d4d03746e042ad.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750258909"},{"id":1,"image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713380/ebe36e8260ff493f738a69325981c081e789693a/ss_ebe36e8260ff493f73